    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000tyy8](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000tyy8) Magnitude 5.9 earthquake at 21.895 depth occurred on Nov 18 2026 79km W of San Nicolas. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -15.1438 longitude -75.9238. It impacted 259 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
